# ============================================================================
# Generated Gin Config
#
# Optimizations:
#   - Attention Backend: cutlass
#   - Recompute LayerNorm: False
#   - Workload Balancer: Enabled
#   - DynamicEmb Caching: True
#   - Cache Ratio: 0.1
#   - Eviction Strategy: lru
#   - Pipeline: none
#   - Tensor Parallel: 1
